    sourceDate: "2026-11-20",
    excerpt: "Air Street Capital is a venture capital firm investing exclusively in AI-first companies across frontier AI, infrastructure, autonomy, defense technology, and TechBio. Founded in 2019 by Nathan Benaich. You are using an outdated browser. Please upgrade your browser to improve your experience and security. Air Street Capital is a venture capital firm investing in AI-first companies, with a focus on North America and Europe. We invest as early as possible and enjoy iterating through product, market and technology strategy from day 0. Our common goal is to create enduring companies that make a lasting impact on their markets. >_ We invest as early as possible and enjoy iterating through product, market and technology strategy from day 1. >_ Our common goal is to create enduring companies that make a lasting impact on their markets.",
