    excerpt: "Bessemer's values are the structure holding the partnership together across generations, geographies, sectors, and stages. Just as steel is only as strong as the composition it's made from and the process that shaped it, our firm is only as good as the people who embody our principles — and the discipline with which we live them. Intellectual Honesty Our most important relationships depend on the mutual trust that arises from intellectual honesty. We strive to obtain and share information with a keen awareness of our cognitive and professional biases. Curiosity Curiosity drives us to question and explore, helping us inspire others and overcome our cynicism. It is only with an eager and open mind that we recognize the greatest opportunities and experience the joy of discovery. Empowerment The organization's effectiveness rests on each of us seizing the opportunity to take ownership of something. We empower and encourage one another to use our best judgment in pursuing opportunities and confronting challenges. Learning & Mentorship Bessemer recognizes that an enduring institution must continually invest in and care for its people, while ensuring an equitable, inclusive environment for individual growth. We recognize that each of us is at once a student and a teacher, with the capacity to learn and mentor throughout one's career and in life. Collaboration Our lasting success is a result of high-performing individuals working in concert. We recognize individual performance and ap",
