    excerpt: "Founded in 2012 in Australia, we now back founders early and repeatedly across APAC’s fastest-growing technology markets. Partnering with Square Peg was a natural choice for us. It’s always exciting to work with and learn from investors, who are founders, about what it takes to build a successful business. Their support remains pivotal to our purpose of connecting entrepreneurs, business builders and creators with borderless opportunities in every corner of the world. Square Peg has been a key investor in Rokt since 2013, and we’ve had the pleasure of working with Paul and the broader team for more than 10 years. Square Peg has backed us on multiple occasions since their first investment, and have provided invaluable strategic input and passionate support since they first invested. We highly value our partnership. I can’t say enough good things about Square Peg - always there with us through the ups and the downs. As founders, sometimes we go through many challenges, so it truly helps that the team at Square Peg reminds us of the bigger picture! The culture, people and team at Square Peg are amazing, humble and intensely founder-friendly. We’re so lucky to have them as a partner through the different stages of our company. Square Peg backed Zeller from the very start of the founder journey - even before we’d written a line of code or given our company a name. As former founders and operators, they understand our mission to reimagin",
