    excerpt: "We partner with sector-defining founders across Europe to create new technologies that disrupt the status quo and solve the problems that matter. Powered by a relentlessly driven ethos that never stops seeking to push boundaries, we foster deeper, actively personal relationships with our partners that drive opportunity, innovation and scale. As a network of hands-on experts – we’re united by a progressive world-view and a pioneering ambition to make a difference. While our fluid, open approach to each opportunity helps make sure we’re able to bring a bespoke service to every single member of our diverse and dynamic portfolio. How BVNK’s Culture Helped Turn A $4 Million Startup Into Mastercard’s $1.8 Billion Acquisition Digital payments are undergoing a structural shift. Correspondent banking networks and closed settlement systems that have moved money for decades are giving way to open, programmable infrastructure capable of settling currencies across borders in real time. “Concentric has provided consistent support to BVNK from the start as a shareholder, business partner and close advisor.” Bitcoin is recapitalising a global economy drowning in debt. To support that mission, Timechain invests in best-in-class bitcoin infrastructure companies. “With Timechain as an investor and supporter, we have been able to accelerate our product development and offer new trading experiences to our users.” Financial services serve as a barometer of technological innovation and its evolutio",
