    sourceUrl: "https://www.breega.com/",
    sourceDate: "2026-11-20",
    excerpt: "Backing world-class founders from pre-Seed to Series A+ in Digital, Climate & Deep Tech across Europe & Africa. Every team member has built or scaled a company. Our investment thesis is simple: we back exceptional founders, sometimes before they even see it themselves, from pre-Seed to Series A+, building Digital, Climate, and Deep Tech startups that don’t just lead categories, but redefine them. As former founders and operators, we build with you every step of the way. With our scaling team as an extension of yours, we bring not just expertise and tactical insights, but a deep commitment to help you optimize operations and scale with confidence. With offices in London & Paris, and on the ground partners throughout Europe & Africa's main tech hubs - we think global and act local. «Thanks for the feedback, which I appreciate because a) it was timely and b) it was very transparent with tangible reasons why we're not a fit - this puts you in the top 1% of investors I talk to!» «I wanted to take the time to thank you for your time and the seriousness and respect with which you conducted this process. We spoke to about fifty investors over the past three months, and you were amongst the most pleasant.»",
