    excerpt: "We invest in breakthrough scientific startups founded by Prime Movers, the inventors who transform billions of lives We invest in startups reinventing energy, transportation, infrastructure, manufacturing, human augmentation, and agriculture Our power draws from our “Why?”, our prime motive, our ultimate purpose: the pursuit and creation of value. Our massive purposeful action serves as the bedrock to empower our teams, families and friends with trust, mutual respect, and benevolence. We surround ourselves with extraordinary individuals who in turn empower us with their vision, skill, and energy. To be a Prime Mover is to be a thermonuclear source of energy powering the world’s progress. Prime Movers transcend self-imposed limitations by penetrating to see the deepest truths. We shed our false beliefs and develop unimpeachable certainty in our own self-worth and our core values. We serve as brilliant lights to guide our fellow humans towards the promise of a better future, free of self-doubt, suffering, poverty, and injustice. Our confidence in ourselves and our allies lifts us all up to achieve the most noble purpose on earth: prosperity for all. These creators of unborrowed vision are the Prime Movers we are named for, and the founders we exist to back. If you are a Prime Mover with a growth mentality and breakthrough scientific inventions, we want to learn about and help you to realize your ambitious plans to revolutionize the most important industries in the world.",
