    excerpt: "We are a high-speed VC fund for tech startups in the Baltics. 01. We focus on early stage. 02. We are the fastest fund in the Baltics. Jonė started her career at IBM to see what tech dinosaurs look like and never wanted to go back to the life of a global corporation. So she dived right into advising startups at Civitta and Startup Division, and later — managing the first VC fund under Startup Wise Guys flagship. 50 investments later, FIRSTPICK was born. Jonė knows it all about fundraising, strategy, and metrics, and is passionate about marketplaces, wellness tech, and fintech. Still in his first months at university, Tadas started at Invest Lithuania before heading to the Lithuanian Embassy in India, where he helped shape Lithuania’s value proposition in Bangalore. That early exposure to how countries and companies compete for talent and capital pulled him toward venture. At FIRSTPICK, he leads the platform, working closely with founders from day one and making sure the network, knowledge, and support around them is actually useful.",
