    sourceDate: "2026-11-20",
    excerpt: "Startmate backs ANZ's most ambitious founders with $120k, a 14-week Accelerator and mentors who invest. Summer '27 applications close 8 November. invest in anz’s top startups Be a first believer in the region's most promising startups alongside Startmate - the most active early-stage ANZ investor. For new investors and veteran angels alike, lean on the best frameworks, founder deal flows and community in ANZ. build your network or land a job Land your dream startup position or build your network with the support of ANZ’s top startup community. Our memberships and programs give you the skills, mentorship, network and job opportunities to excel in your career as a startup operator. Startmate gives founders permission to dream and the confidence to go further through mentoring, support & inclusiveness. What makes it special? A culture bigger than money; a community where ambition is shared, supported & celebrated. Startmate is the mouth of the river for ANZ startups. From Demo Day’s energy and world-class ideas to a community that grows in ambition year after year, it’s where founders, investors & operators all find their place; the real magic is the people. Startmate is a rare community where people give more than they take. It surrounds founders with the “village” they need; mentors, investors, peers, to do their best work. Year after year, that culture unlocks ambition and makes Startmate a launchpad for world-class startups. The real Startmate “special sauce” isn’t just comm",
