    sourceUrl: "https://www.permira.com/",
    sourceDate: "2026-11-20",
    excerpt: "Permira Private Equity multiplies the potential of companies, leaders and our own people to build successful businesses with sustainable growth ambitions. Our Flagship strategy focuses on control investing in the upper mid-market, primarily in Europe and North America. We seek to back global, market-leading companies benefitting from structural growth trends in four core sectors —Technology, Consumer, Services and Healthcare — and partner with management teams to drive transformation at scale. A global specialist credit manager offering Private Credit solutions in Europe and a transatlantic Liquid Credit platform. A global team bound by a distinct culture. Our collaborative and entrepreneurial outlook unites a diverse team of 500+ individuals across 15 offices around the world. Our Ascent strategy applies the same thematic, sector-led approach as our Flagship strategy to mid-market growth companies primarily across Europe and North America, with a focus on control, co-control and high-governance structures. Responsible investing and a commitment to sustainability guide our outlook. We take a long-term, proactive approach to considering sustainability risks and opportunities across the investment lifecycle. We're supporting management teams and entrepreneurs to drive technology-led transformation and long-term value creation across four core sectors. Partnership. Integrity. Creativity. Our values and the basis for a dynamic and rewarding work environment. Take a look at the di",
    note: "",
    logo: "/logos/permira.png",
    synthetic: false,
    confirmed: false,
    currency: "GBP",
    files: [{"title": "About", "text": "Growing an ambitious business into an industry leader is a challenge. That’s why companies need the support of an experienced partner. Kurt Björklund, Executive Chairman, discusses how our sector teams use their insights and expertise to identify growth themes in today’s rapidly evolving world. We have a global presence of 15 offices across Europe, the United States, the Middle East and Asia. Our expert teams work collaboratively to support the growth ambitions and strategic goals of our portfolio companies. Our thematic investment approach has focused on specific sectors for over 40 years, generating deep knowledge and broad perspectives in technology, consumer, healthcare and services. Our Value Creation Team consists of 20 professionals with diverse operational backgrounds and skillsets, and our broad network of Senior Advisers are able to apply decades of industry experience and specific functional expertise to help management teams build better, stronger businesses."}],

