    excerpt: "Prosus is a global consumer internet group and one of the largest technology investors in the world. Our ecosystem unlocks an AI-first world where billions of people can live, work and thrive. Our leadership Our leadership about Prosus is the power behind the world’s leading lifestyle <br/>e-commerce brands Through our ecosystems we help billions of consumers to buy, sell and transact through food, Fintech, experiences and commerce platforms, providing them with access to the world’s leading lifestyle e-commerce brands. Using AI, we simplify the often-fragmented experience for consumer buyers and sellers, providing an integrated and frictionless approach for lifestyle e-commerce businesses and consumers alike. Our purpose is to unlock an AI-first world for billions of people. This purpose defines our reason for being and the positive impact we have on the world. The Prosus Way is our way of working and thinking. It is our values. A guiding set of principles that underpins our culture and defines the work we do and the way we collaborate and engage with each other. Prosus was listed on the Euronext Amsterdam in September 2019 and is the number one lifestyle e-commerce company in Europe, India and Latin America. We build ecosystems in high-growth markets that power the world’s leading lifestyle e-commerce brands. Our geographic footprint is truly global, with interests in over 100 markets.",
