    excerpt: "Internet services include fiber, ethernet, T1 and SD-WAN. We also deliver crystal clear, digital phone services such as hosted PBX as well as SIP trunks! Our diverse array of telecom and internet services include fiber, ethernet, T1 and SD-WAN. We operate the premiere co-location facility in the vibrant downtown Long Beach district. Eliminating the need for local businesses to commute to LA or Orange county for colo services.",
