    summary: "Artisan automates your outbound with an all-in-one, AI-first platform powered by AI employees. Get better outbound sales results with an AI BDR. Solutions Resources Pricing Get a demo Login Get started Get a demo Login Get started Product Ava, the AI BDR NEW Looking for AI employees for all roles? Meet The AI BDR that runs in your stack, alongside your team Ava finds leads, enriches them, sends personalized messages, and books meetings on behalf of your reps. With Ava 2.0 you get full control over outbound working alongside your reps to scale efficiently. We've replaced our entire outbound sales team with Artisan, and they help close $100K deals day after day. Some teams plug Ava into their stack, others hand her the whole motion. You can switch whenever you're ready. Ava plugs into the tools you already run and does the heavy lifting inside them. Your team keeps working where they already do. Two-way sync with your CRM, no migration Sends as your reps, respects account owners Reps don't need to adopt another tool Manual touches queued as rep tasks As your outbound stack Consolidate data, sequencing, dialing, and booking into one platform, and let Ava run the whole motion. 250M+ contact database and enrichment built in Replaces ZoomInfo, Nooks, Outreach, and more Cut the subscription sprawl and per-seat fees End-to-end autopilot when you're ready How Ava runs outbound autonomously Set your outbound strategy once. Ava finds the leads, runs the campaigns, and books the meetings",
