    summary: "4.9/5 from 28,479 customers Sign up with Google Sign up with email Get started for free. No credit card required. Publish your best work, grow your audience, unlock new revenue, and understand what's working. beehiiv brings it all together, no digital duct tape required. Podcasts Publish your show, grow your audience everywhere, and connect your show to the rest of your business with just a few clicks. Distribute everywhere Publish once and automatically send episodes to Spotify, Apple Podcasts, Overcast, and more. Built for growth Every episode creates new opportunities to reach, engage, and grow your audience. Real-time reporting Monitor performance as it happens and understand how listeners engage across listening platforms. Website connection Every episode gets a dedicated landing page complete with transcripts, playlists, SEO optimization, and more. Digital Products Sell your expertise directly to your audience. From webinars and strategy sessions to guides and gated content, you can earn with 0% commission. 0% commission forever Create and sell digital products once, automate delivery, and keep every dollar you earn. Automate sales Upsell products, collect testimonials & reviews, and nurture customers on autopilot. Show off your product Highlight details, previews, and value upfront with clear visuals and upgraded layouts. Sell to everyone Accept international currencies and offer Apple Pay and Google Pay for fast, familiar checkout. Sell anywhere Publish product pages",
    person: null,
    funder: "",
    source: "Company site",
    sourceUrl: "https://www.beehiiv.com/",
    files: [{"title": "About", "text": "beehiiv was founded in 2021 by early employees at Morning Brew who helped turn a newsletter into a major media company and saw the power of owning an audience firsthand. We also saw how much custom technology and industry expertise it took to get there. So we built beehiiv to make those capabilities available to anyone with an audience. And while we started as a newsletter platform, our users made it clear they wanted more. Now, beehiiv is the newsletter-first platform helping creators and brands grow beyond the inbox with websites, podcasts, communities, subscriptions, digital products, and the industry's largest native ad network. The next great audience-led businesses won't be determined by who has the biggest team or the deepest pockets. If you have something worth sharing, we'll give you everything you need to make it succeed. We're 100% remote, spread across 12 countries, and genuinely like each other. We come from media, tech, finance, and a few places you wouldn't expect. But we all believe great ideas deserve the tools to grow into something bigger."}],

