    id: "descript",
    name: "Descript",
    website: "https://www.descript.com/",
    logo: "/logos/descript.png",
    stage: "Early",
    round: null,
    summary: "Descript is the AI video and audio editor that makes editing as easy as editing text. Record, transcribe, edit, and publish in one tool. Try it free. Meet Underlord Our AI assistant can do anything you need to bring your creative vision to life. Explore quick tutorials that show you how to create, edit and share your content with Descript. Direct your AI co-editor to do your video editing for you, or do it yourself with intuitive editing tools. With Descript, video editing is as easy as typing. Enterprise teams at Amazon, Canva, Salesforce, and tons of others use Descript. Is that good enough for you? “Descript changed our workflow by turning hours of timeline scrubbing into quick insights and batch social cuts. That's saved our team significant time.” “What sold me on Descript was the ease of having a recording solution and an editing solution in the same platform.” “If your plan is to scale your academy large and globally, and you have a small team that you need to make mighty, Descript is a really powerful companion to have.” Some footage you shot. A script you wrote. A Zoom call. Whatever you’ve got, drop it in. Descript transcribes it in seconds—then you're off and editing. Edit your words to edit your video. Copy-paste, drag-and-drop. Cut filler words and retakes in a click. The timeline's there if you need it. Clean up your audio, correct your eye contact, fix your lighting, smooth all those jump cuts. One click apiece. Send a link, get comments right on the video. Ins",
    person: null,
    funder: "",
    source: "Company site",
    sourceUrl: "https://www.descript.com/",
    files: [{"title": "About", "text": "Descript is a video editing app that does it all. It makes it easy for anyone to record, edit, and share any video, and it’s got all the power you need to create something you’re proud of. In Descript your team can make video together without a bunch of annoying file sharing. If you work alone, by choice or because of your insufferable perfectionism, you can collaborate with Underlord, Descript’s built-in, eager-to-please AI co-editor. Descript was invented by a team of creative people who hated working in the timeline and knew there must be a better way. Turns out there were lots of better ways—text-based editing, automated design, prompt-based editing, and soon, ocular implants. We’re not really doing implants, we just said it to impress potential investors. Speaking of, Descript has raised a total of $100M, primarily from the OpenAI Startup Fund, Andreessen Horowitz, Redpoint Ventures, and Spark Capital. Among our individual investors: Daniel Gross, Devdatta Akhawe, Alex Blumberg, Jack Conte, Justine Ezarik, Todd Goldberg, Jean-Denis Greze, John Lilly, Tobi Lutke, Bharat Mediratta, Shishir Mehrotra, Casey Neistat, Brian Pokorny, Raghavendra Prabhu, Lenny Rachitsky, Naval Ravikan"}],

