    round: null,
    summary: "Find buyers from your website, enrich emails and phones, research why-now signals and dial up to five lines at once. Free built-in CRM on every plan. RegieGO uses your website to find matching buyers, enrich contacts, and research reasons to connect, with emails and call scripts ready for you to review and use. RegieGO reads your website and suggests companies and roles to target. Refine your ICP in chat, find matching accounts, and get buyers’ emails and phone numbers through waterfall enrichment. Already have target accounts or a prospect list? Bring it into RegieGO to find the right people and enrich their contact details. Acme.com Target roles VP Sales, Director... Company Best match role Employees Match S Stripe VP of Sales VP of Sales 1,100 F Figma Director of Sales Director of Sales 1,200 N Notion Head of Sales Head of Sales 800 02 · Personalize your approach RegieGO researches each account and buyer to find relevant reasons to reach out. It turns that research into emails and call scripts using your pitch and voice. Approve the messages or make them your own. Just tell RegieGO what you’d like to change in chat. Research this account and draft an email using our pitch and voice. Research Email Call script Subject: An idea for your sales team Hi Sarah, I work with sales leaders at payments companies and wanted to share a quick idea on how we help similar teams increase pipeline generation. Send emails and reach more buyers with the built-in parallel dialer. Keep buyer r",
