    stage: "Seed",
    round: null,
    summary: "Search API for AI agents that need real-time web data, deep research, and structured content from one endpoint. Try our API for free. Use this file to discover Exa products, pricing, evaluations, comparisons, use cases, agent interfaces, and technical documentation before exploring further. Search Agent latency Lite 200ms Auto 1s Deep ~10s category Full Web News Companies Research People Financials API Playground output Results Answer Structured API Playground Request Response Join 900,000+ developers building AI on top of the world’s information. Read customer stories → ↗ → ↗ → ↗ → ↗ → ↗ → ↗ → Search built for your AI The fastest, most accurate web search API. Give your agents the context they need. Exa 3.0 leads on BrowseComp, DSQA, and WideSearch, the standard benchmarks for search agents. Comprehensive coverage over all search verticals so your agent has the right context to solve its problem airplanes , rotorcraft , rockets , satellites , and missiles worldwide. The company also provides leasing and product support services. Boeing is among the largest global aerospace manufacturers ; it is the fourth-largest defense contractor in the world based on 2022 revenue and is the largest exporter in the United States by dollar value. Boeing was founded in 1916 by William E. Boeing in Seattle , Washington. \"content\" : { \"companies\" : [ { \"company_name\" : \"GE Aerospace\", \"ceo_name\" : \"Larry Culp\", \"founded_year\" : 1892 }, { \"company_name\" : \"RTX\", \"ceo_name\" : \"Christopher T. Cal",
