    summary: "Cohere builds powerful models and AI solutions enabling enterprises to automate processes, empower employees, and turn fragmented data into actionable insights. North by Cohere is a complete agentic enterprise AI platform that you control and deploy on your terms. Your freedom. Your focus. Cohere keeps it that way. Learn how AI helps you reclaim time for what truly moves you. A fully ownable agentic platform built to bring peak security, intelligence, cost efficiency, and control together. Tools for generative AI, advanced search, and multilingual capabilities—built to keep your enterprise in full control. AI solutions that drive growth, reduce risk, and enhance customer experiences with speed and precision. Automate workflows, unify systems, and surface real-time insights to serve citizens faster, more securely, and at lower cost. Turn your data into your differentiator, streamline dev workflows, and launch AI experiences at scale with Cohere. Maximize uptime, cut operating costs, and modernize critical infrastructure with AI built for the 24/7 demands of energy and utilities companies. Our platform and models meet rigorous standards across security, availability, processing integrity, confidentiality, and privacy.",
