    round: null,
    summary: "Apollo is the AI sales platform rebuilt as one connected AI GTM system: data, intelligence, and execution for the entire go-to-market motion. Join over 600,000 companies using Apollo Run your go-to-market, your way Run your GTM motion in Apollo, or plug it into the tools you already use. Either way, your data stays connected and your team stays in sync. Turn fragmented data into a single, complete view of every prospect and account — so your team and your agents always work from the same picture. Agents will research, build lists, write outreach, follow up, and book meetings — prompting you at all the key moments. Give every rep, workflow, and agent reliable data to work from. Apollo helps keep your records fresh, complete, and ready to act on. Data feeds intelligence. Intelligence drives execution. Execution creates more data. Every interaction makes the next one smarter. Data Your own data, Apollo's proprietary data, and third-party signals, unified in one place. Agents learn your business, then research accounts, prioritize leads, write outreach, and book meetings. Launch outreach from Apollo's Workspace, or take it into the tools your team already lives in. Agents are designed to help keep your prospecting compliant, with built-in support for consent and opt-out rules It’s time to run your GTM like a system, not a set of tools Finally, everything your team needs to find, reach, and close deals — connected. Ready to get started? Get verified emails and phone numbers and in",
