    stage: "",
    round: null,
    summary: "Greenhouse is more than a hiring platform or ATS. We’re a complete hiring ecosystem that brings employers and job seekers together in one place. Qualified job seekers for each role, from millions already in MyGreenhouse, brought forward right when a role opens. Fraud detection Greenhouse Real Talent™ flags fraud and misrepresentation, verifies candidates and prioritizes the best-fit applicants so you can focus on the real, qualified people in your pipeline. AI interviewing Greenhouse Voice AI provides a structured first conversation that helps teams identify qualified candidates more reliably than resumes. Notetaker Greenhouse Notetaker records, transcribes and summarizes interviews, then maps AI-generated notes to scorecard questions so interviewers can stay focused on the conversation and provide accurate feedback. Scheduling Greenhouse Scheduling brings interview coordination to where your team already does its hiring, helping you meet your scheduling needs in one place, move faster and deliver a smoother candidate experience. Reporting & analytics Greenhouse Analytics helps teams make faster, confident decisions. With AI-powered Chart Builder, turn plain-language questions into clear visualizations for instant insights. AI agents Greenhouse AI and agentic workflows bring intelligent assistance to recruiters every day, reducing busywork so you can stay focused on moving hiring forward while remaining in control. MCP & integrations Connect Greenhouse to the AI and business",
