    summary: "Make allows you to visually build, scale and automate AI and agentic workflows. User friendly no-code integration tool. Try it now for free! Make Waves ’26. Find out everything we’ve announced to build a more transparent future for AI agents in business Salesforce HubSpot CRM HubSpot CRM Slack Slack Perplexity AI Perplexity AI OpenAI (ChatGPT, Whisper) OpenAI (ChatGPT, Whisper) Show all integrations Resources GET STARTED Integrations 3500+ app integrations Build and manage AI agents and automations in one visual landscape Connect any app, data source, or AI model. Build by prompt, drag-and-drop, or from Claude, ChatGPT, and any other AI chat. Connect your whole tech stack and the latest AI models. Add custom integrations to anything with an API. Power AI transformation in your business Put AI agents and workflows in the hands of every team – stay in control of everything they build. \"We literally refer to Make as the glue of our organization - anything that our dealerships interact with goes in and back out of Make to our own infrastructure.\" GDPR, SOC 2 Type II and SOC 3. Encryption in transit and at rest, SSO, and access controls that satisfy a security review. Role-based access, audit logs and real-time analytics across every workflow automation your teams run. Make is an AI automation platform. You build automated workflows and AI agents visually, connect them to the apps and data you already use, and see everything running in one place. It's built for",
