    logo: "/logos/zapier.png",
    stage: "",
    round: null,
    summary: "Build and scale AI workflows and agents across 9,000+ apps with Zapier—the most connected AI orchestration platform. Trusted by 3 million+ businesses. Explore templates Explore use cases Join Zapier Early Access Industry comparisons Implement AI orchestration Three phases to move from disconnected AI pilots to orchestrated systems that scale. Fluid Determinism is Zapier’s unique approach to cost-effective, reliable AI. You build with natural language; Zapier suggests where to use AI and then adjusts your workflow as it runs—reducing token use for steps that run the same way every time but adding it back when the unexpected happens. Deterministic You choose the tools and steps. Every step follows fixed rules and runs the same way every time. AI handles a single task in a workflow, like writing or summarizing. Deterministic steps handle the rest. An embedded agent uses approved tools and instructions to complete multi-step work, then hands it off to deterministic steps. An agent plans, adapts, and works across tools to achieve your goal, bringing you in for review as needed. You set the steps. Every ticket gets an auto-reply and goes to a rep, the same way every time. Features Enterprise-grade security We maintain SOC 2 Type II, SOC 3, GDPR, and CCPA compliance One policy across your systems Set precise controls at the app, action, and connection level Total visibility See every agent action and workflow run in one place, along with its owner and the systems involved Explore go",
    person: null,
