    stage: "",
    round: null,
    summary: "Build with Lakebase Postgres, Auth, Functions, Storage, and an AI Gateway: instant, branchable, serverless. Authentication . Fully-managed user auth in every database for free, built on Better Auth. OPERATE IT WITH AGENTS 02 Ready for coding agents. Create and branch environments the way you work with PRs, with full access via MCP, CLI, and SDK. Instant operations Infrastructure that responds instantly. Agents don't wait for servers, tickets, or manual provisioning. Give every idea its own environment. Agents can work in isolated copies of your entire backend. Fast development requires fast recovery. Every change can be isolated, tested, and rolled back. User Authentication Ask for follow-up changes 5.5 SCALE YOUR APP AND AGENT 03 Scale from your first users to the Fortune 500. Startups ship on the same Neon primitives that enterprise teams run in production. WHERE STARTUPS START From Bootstrapped to VC Funded, Startups Ship Faster on Neon. The lakebase architecture decouples storage and compute to deliver instant operations and scale without compromise on performance or reliability. Neon monitors your database load ten times a second and autoscales CPU and memory to exactly fit your workload. Usage-based pricing Pay for what you use, not for the infrastructure you might need. Neon is built for a world where developers create, test, and scale more than ever. Start free, experiment freely, and pay only for the resources your applications actual",
