    logo: "/logos/xata.png",
    stage: "Seed",
    round: null,
    summary: "Discover how Xata’s creators built Xata to deliver instant branches, zero-downtime schema changes, and advanced developer workflows for any Postgres. @ rauchg X This is the new gold standard for frontend and backend workflow. Preview your @vercel frontend alongside your @xatabase, with schema changes and automatic (and safe!) data staging. One of the things I love about using @xata is their UI Makes it so easy to manage data on-the-fly 👏 And this works beautifully with their Postgres solution being able to easily adapt your table for interaction @ wesbos X Checking out @xata as a DB to store + query vector embeddings . Big fan so far, great typescript integration. Ran 30,000 updates on the free plan in ~10 mins and instead of rejecting with a rate limit, they just delay the response a ~1s. No extra code needed on my end",
