    logo: "/logos/sentry.png",
    stage: "",
    round: null,
    summary: "Application performance monitoring for developers & software teams to see errors clearer, solve issues faster & continue learning continuously. Get started at sentry.io. Sentry MCP: fix production issues right from your LLM ➔ Code breaks, fix it faster Application monitoring software considered \"not bad\" by millions of developers. lyft Factory.ai Logo lyft Factory.ai Logo GitHub Disney Atlassian Linear Vercel Cloudflare Slack Metronome Autodesk Microsoft Instacart Lyft Bolt Monday Cursor Anthropic Factory AI Sentry Baseten Runlayer Convex Supabase Developer first. Always. Monitor in five lines Drop in the SDK . No agents to install. No performance surprises. Agent tracing helps you catch unexpected output issues, bad tool calls and visualize the spend and performance across all your agents. From GitHub , Slack , Jira , and Linear to coding agents with Sentry's MCP server , Sentry brings full context to every fix from dev to prod. Previous Next Monitor in five lines Drop in the SDK .",
    person: null,
    funder: "",
