    round: null,
    summary: "We power faster and safer online payments with our open banking payments network. Onboard users, accept payments & make payouts in seconds. Learn more today. Discover what you can save with Pay by Bank Try our savings calculator Our customers A world without cards means... Lowering payment costs by 40% Cut out multiple middle-men taking a slice, plus all the costs associated with card fraud and chargebacks. Reinvest the savings and bump up your bottom line. Increasing AOV by 20% Taking away any friction at the checkout not only boosts sales but sees returning customers converting at up to 90%. 71% of customers choosing Pay by Bank With card fraud set to grow by a further $10bn by 2028, give your customers a card-network-free-zone, and rest assured you’ll be watching them use it. Handling almost half of all UK Pay by Bank payments, and more than 2x the daily volume of our nearest competitors, the TrueLayer infrastructure and technology is tried, tested and built for enterprise businesses. What users think Plus customers love it “ With Pay by Bank, you don’t have to get up to find your card, or add in any details at all. Frankly, it saves so much time. Plus, because of the biometrics, I trust that the payment method is safe and secure. Our benefits We’re levelling the paying field Simplicity Goodbye to 16-digit cards which are slow and were designed for the physical world. Hello to modern digital payments, which are instant and were designed for the consumers and businesses of",
