    summary: "Let your customers pay at their own pace: in instalments or later. Improve their payment experience and boost your turnover by 20%. Professionals Individuals France en fr Belgium fr nl Luxembourg fr Netherlands nl Spain es Italy it Germany de Portugal pt Options Payment in 2, 3 or 4 installments Let your customers pay at their own pace. Your business accelerates. Discover instalments with Alma. Get paid upfront—no chasing collections. Your payouts are 100% guaranteed with no risk of non‑payment. A solution that fits all your sales channels E‑commerce website Customers pay online in under 30 seconds without leaving your website. Customers pay via a payment link sent on their smartphone or directly on your payment terminal. Tailored to the needs of retailers The same guarantees for every merchant. Clear and transparent with Alma. France, Germany, Belgium, Spain, Italy, Luxembourg, the Netherlands and Portugal. Keep selling with Alma. 25% of sales volume in BNPL - Maisons du Monde \"To tell the truth, it's one of the best levers in several respects: profitability, visibility, improved conversion rates, not to mention customer loyalty.… +50% on average basket size with Alma - Jonak \"The challenge was to integrate the solution in such a way as to generate real value for the brand in terms of increasing the average basket size. The effect… 45% of web sales with Alma - MATY Group \"Alma's support for our customers has been decisive. When they make a purchase in-store via Alma, they re",
