    name: "Wealthsimple",
    website: "https://www.wealthsimple.com/en-ca",
    logo: "/logos/wealthsimple.png",
    stage: "",
    round: null,
    summary: "Being better than a bank means more of everything. Spend, trade and invest with Wealthsimple. Something good just happened. Catch up on all the products we shared at the last Wealthsimple Presents . T&Cs apply . By providing your information you consent to receiving communications from Wealthsimple. You may withdraw consent at any time. By signing up, you agree to Wealthsimple’s Terms of Use and Privacy Policy . Contact us at privacy@wealthsimple.com or 80 Spadina Ave., Toronto, ON. Trade Commission-free stocks & ETFs, $0 equity options contracts, and crypto Invest Expertly built portfolios for every kind of investor Advice Advisors to help you take control of your wealth Business Chequing, investing, and group plans for businesses Wealthsimple Chequing A phone displaying UI of Wealthsimple's app, displaying how much you're spending, saving, and investing. A phone displaying UI of Wealthsimple's app, displaying how much you're spending, saving, and investing. Wealthsimple Credit card Welcome to the future of money Why are we here? Because we knew there was a better way. To save more, trade smarter, lower fees, invest like a pro, and even earn real interest on a chequing account. Welcome to the fastest growing financial company in Canada. Built for what comes next. As of April 21, 2026 Wealthsimple has the fastest asset and trading volume growth in Canadian online brokerages in 2025 according to data collected by Investor Insight and Institutional Shareholder Services Canada I",
    person: null,
    funder: "",
    source: "Company site",
    sourceUrl: "https://www.wealthsimple.com/en-ca",
    files: [{"title": "About", "text": "We started Wealthsimple because investing in Canada felt like you needed a Ph.D to understand it. We set out to strip away the confusing jargon, hidden fees, and frustrating client experience to build something entirely different. Whether it's advice, investing, trading stocks or crypto, saving and spending a paycheque, or tax filing, we've helped millions of Canadians wrap their heads around it all. Our mission has never changed: To help everyone achieve financial freedom. It means feeling free from financial stress and more secure every day, no matter what life throws at you. Our Financial Products Advisory Committee is made up of recognized thought leaders in finance and innovation. They're a sounding board for our team across products and investment management."}],

