    id: "wayflyer",
    name: "Wayflyer",
    website: "https://wayflyer.com/",
    logo: "/logos/wayflyer.png",
    stage: "",
    round: null,
    summary: "Wayflyer has provided $7b+ to 7,000+ businesses across eCommerce, retail, software & services. Apply in less than 10 minutes and access capital in hours. From $10k to $20m. No personal guarantees. No equity taken. Backed by world-leading financial institutions. Tell us about your business 01 Securely connect your platforms 02 Get approved for financing 03 Tell us about your business 01 Securely connect your platforms 02 Get approved for financing 03 Trusted by Application Process Terms Customers Underwriting Process FAQs Make funding your business a breathtakingly smooth experience. No, seriously. 01 . Confirm your eligibility You know the full cost before you accept. No hidden charges or complicated fee structures. Pick a bi-weekly or monthly repayment schedule. Repay in fixed amounts or as a percentage of sales. Marketing Growth Hiring Shipping No personal guarantees. We fund the business, not the person. Business funding $82,784.00 No personal liability Trusted by thousands of the world’s best businesses Trusted by 7,000+ of the world’s best businesses “Wayflyer isn’t just a finance provider they’re a strategic growth partner for founders looking to scale quickly while maintaining ownership. Wayflyer is a gamechanger.” “We applied and got the money pretty quickly. But the team really wanted to get to know me, my business model, and what the money was for.” “Before Wayflyer we had a venture debt deal and it was very stressful. The second we switched over, everything was eas",
    person: null,
    funder: "",
    source: "Company site",
    sourceUrl: "https://wayflyer.com/",
    files: [{"title": "About", "text": "Leadership Backed by 400+ employees with startup experience and deep, firsthand knowledge of how growing businesses operate. He co-founded the company in 2019 to help fast-growing businesses access the working capital needed to scale. John McAdoo is the Chief Financial Officer at Wayflyer, where he oversees the company's financial strategy, and long-term growth initiatives. Deirdre MacCarthy is Wayflyer's Chief Legal Officer and Head of People, with 20+ years advising high-growth tech companies and entrepreneurs. Wayflyer was founded by Aidan Corbett and Jack Pierse to solve the biggest problem for growing consumer brands: access to working capital. Our first cash advance was sent to Ambr Eyewear. Sharing our passion for solving this problem, their founder later joined our team. We signed our first major warehouse line with J.P. Morgan, the first of multiple institutional debt partnerships to come. We broadened our focus to serve SMBs across all major industries, driven by strong market demand and the opportunity to back great businesses in every vertical."}],

