    stage: "",
    round: null,
    summary: "Build, launch and scale modern investing, savings and banking products with Shares’ technology and financial infrastructure Shares Wealth offers an investment app for individuals and a white-label investment platform for wealth management firms and private banks. Shares Workplace provides technology services to financial institutions. Since 5 October, following the acquisition of Treezor SAS, Shares Banking provides payment solutions to businesses. Shares Financial Assets is a French simplified joint-stock company (société par actions simplifiée, SAS), registered with the Paris Trade and Companies Register under number 914 036 793, with its registered office at 6 rue Abel Truchet, 75017 Paris, France. These authorisations can be verified on the ACPR website through the French Register of Financial Agents (REGAFI). Technology services are provided by Shares SAS, registered with the Paris Trade and Companies Register under number 898 574 140, with its registered office at 6 rue Abel Truchet, 75017 Paris, France. No information on this website should be construed as an investment recommendation or investment advice. If you are unsure, we encourage you to consult a financial adviser. All investments carry a risk of capital loss. If you have any questions or need assistance, please contact us at support@shares.io. Our team will be happy to help.",
    person: null,
