    summary: "Mux helps teams ship high-performance and cost-effective video in minutes, not months. Build better video into anything from websites to platforms to AI workflows. Upload Unlock the data in your video More than just content, video contains a boatload of data for you to build with. Select a video to see Mux in action. Understand video analytics at a glance Track key engagement and video intelligence metrics: views, playing time, viewer retention, top performing content, and more. K Views 22% Unique Viewers 2.9 k k 1.3 17% 3 PM 6 PM Playing Time h 1.7 36% Last 6h One week ago + + + + Deploy Mux Robots Integrate Mux's pre-built AI workflows or build your own. Our platform is built for humans and robots, from streaming to analysis and everything in between. The video infrastructure for your website From background videos to simple player embeds, we’ve got you covered. Commerce-UI built Lady Gaga’s immersive website with video front and center. After launch, they saw a 128% increase in add-to-cart rate and 55% increase in average order value. While you perfect your AI models, we take care of encoding, delivery, and scaling your video output reliably and cost-effectively. Synthesia built their AI video platform on Mux enabling them to affordably scale video generation while focusing on AI innovation rather than building video from scratch. Patreon built native video for a more consistent creator and fan experience, going from limited control with third-party solutions to a fully cu",
