    round: null,
    summary: "Copper is the CRM software built into Google Workspace. Manage leads, deals and projects in one CRM platform trusted by 30,000+ companies. Try it for free. Get a demo Consulting Coaching Agencies Construction Creators Media Financial Advisors Production Copper is trusted by 30,000+ companies of all sizes No more switching tabs. Run your whole business from your CRM . Google Workspace Activity Feed Sales & Projects Mobile App \"I work in consulting and keeping my tech stack small is important . I don't want to spend all day clicking between apps just to get work done. Copper's smooth integration with Gmail is a godsend.\" Whether it's referrals, paid ads, events or organic, wherever your leads come from, Copper can collect and take immediate action. Add every lead Use our contact form for website visitors, or scan business cards at events. Email series & automations Respond instantly to form submissions and send welcome or follow up emails. Google Workspace Add leads, track conversations, find files or manage tasks directly in Gmail and Google Calendar. Know where every lead is at in your sales process and move opportunities to the next stage. Sort by value, understand the win probability, and identify slipping deals. Pipelines Make sales more visual using drag-and-drop pipelines with AI-powered flags and alerts. Pipeline automations Automatically trigger emails or reminders when you move an opportunity to the next stage. Reporting Create custom reports to project revenue, ident",
    person: null,
    funder: "",
    source: "Company site",
    sourceUrl: "https://www.copper.com/",
    files: [{"title": "About", "text": "Most CRM software was built for big sales teams with a dedicated admin and a six-month setup. We built Copper for everyone else: the agencies, the consultants, the account managers whose whole job runs on relationships. We reimagined what CRM software could look like inside the tools you already use every day — starting with Google Workspace. Copper is fast, intuitive, and built to feel familiar from day one — because it lives right inside Gmail, Calendar, and Drive. There's no switching tabs, no learning a whole new system, and no lengthy team onboarding required. Every notification, every follow-up, every deal in your pipeline represents a real person on the other end. Copper CRM exists to help you show up for those people — and build a business that grows because of it. We’re a down-to-earth group of professionals with decades of experience, building value-oriented software for businesses, rooted in our mission to help the workforce thrive. We want our customers to grow their businesses and we believe that helping them cultivate t"}],

