    id: "crisp",
    name: "Crisp",
    website: "https://crisp.chat/en/",
    logo: "/logos/crisp.png",
    stage: "",
    round: null,
    summary: "Crisp is the ultimate all-in-one AI-powered multichannel messaging platform that helps businesses connect instantly with their customers or leads who are waiting for support. With its quickly evolving set of tools, Crisp is leading businesses through the AI-driven revolution by using conversations to unlock hypergrowth. Included in the Crisp Plus plan Build your perfect AI Agent in 4 steps Step 1 Train your AI Teach Crisp about your product or business, using the public and private resources you already have. We automatically browse your website for you, but you can also import PDFs and write Knowledge Base articles. Create an AI Agent workflow, using our no-code AI Agent builder or browse through our library of templates to kickstart your new support experience. Deploy your AI Agent workflow, choosing which messaging channel you want it to trigger from: Web chat widget, WhatsApp, Messenger, Instagram, and even email. See the messages that your users exchanged with your AI Agent. Refine your AI Agent if an answer was invalid. Quickly iterate to automate most of your customer support. All your inbound conversations from all channels go into one collaborative inbox. Your team can access, manage, and respond to messages efficiently. Leverage the power of asynchronous communication by creating, editing, and managing help articles. Create your own help center that fits your brand. Not ready for customer-facing AI agents? Crisp lets you craft internal workflows to speed up teams' r",
    person: null,
    funder: "",
    source: "Company site",
    sourceUrl: "https://crisp.chat/en/",
    files: [{"title": "About", "text": "At Crisp, we're not just a company; we're a revolution in customer support. Born in 2015 with an unyielding entrepreneurial and \"hacker\" spirit, our ambition is clear: to be the \"Apple\" of customer support software. Innovation isn't just what we do; it's who we are. Fully bootstrapped since inception, we thrive without venture capital influence, ensuring our vision remains undiluted and true to our roots. Long before remote work became a global norm, Crisp embraced it. We began as a 100% remote team, and even with our Nantes, France office established in 2018, we maintain a globally distributed team. Our remote-friendly culture isn't just a policy; it's a testament to our belief in the power of diversity and global perspectives. We operate in a flat organizational structure because we know that great ideas don't need ladders to climb. We detest slow-moving processes, but we're champions of well-defined, efficient workflows. Our love for technology and design isn't just a preference; it's a passion. We believe the alchemy of strong tech and stunning design crafts unparalleled cus"}],

