    stage: "",
    round: null,
    summary: "Manage sales and customer relationships directly inside Gmail. Streak is the CRM your team will actually use—integrated, smart, and loved by 750,000+ users. Welcome to Streak! Learn how information is organized in Streak and discover key features for managing your workflow. Streak is built directly into Gmail. This quick tour shows how Streak appears across your inbox. First time using Streak? New user I haven’t set up a Streak account Existing user I have already set up my pipeline What’s your desktop browser? Chrome Safari Edge You’ll need to use a desktop browser to set up your Streak account. You can install Streak now and finish setup on desktop later. To get started with Chrome, install Streak from the Chrome Web Store on your desktop. Share your email and we'll send you the install link directly. To get started with Safari, install Streak from the Mac App store on your desktop. To get started with Edge, install Streak from the Edge Add-ons store on your desktop. Use Streak on the go If you’ve installed Streak and completed onboarding on desktop, you can install the Streak app to access your pipelines on mobile. Streak is smart. It uses your team's inbox activity to fill itself out, answer questions, and suggest next steps. AI data entry keeps deals up to date Keep your CRM up to date without manual data entry Replay Ask questions in natural lang",
