    round: null,
    summary: "Automate and scale payouts, onboard vendors seamlessly, customize approval flows, and more — for 30% less. Whether you make 100s or 1000s of monthly payments, Routable is designed to handle high-volume payouts. Make international payments in as little as 1-3 business days, in 140+ currencies, to 220+ countries and territories around the world. Send thousands of payments worldwide with a single CSV file upload. Efficient, secure, and designed for your growing business needs. Step 1 Invite new payees from your dashboard in minutes, and import contacts from your accounting software. Step 2 Streamline collecting bank and payment details and request tax information upfront. Step 3 Offer custom-branded onboarding so your vendors know they’re working with your business, not a third party. Scale your payment operations with complete control Improve every aspect of vendor management from seamless on-brand onboarding to new levels of tax filing accuracy. Reduce manual data entry by 80%, freeing up your team to focus on strategic financial analysis and cost control. Routable automates payouts at scale and saves companies millions of hours while meeting rigorous standards. 5x faster payments Case study 20,000+ payments per month Case study 90+ hours saved monthly Case study 40% cost savings Case study 3x faster bill payment Case study Modern teams save with Routable Time saved on manual tasks Routable family of trademarks are owned by Routable Inc. All other trademarks appearing on this",
