    summary: "Compensation management software that streamlines pay review cycles, salary benchmarking, and total rewards statements — without a thousand spreadsheets. Maximize visibility and streamline decisions while avoiding costly mistakes in your next compensation cycle. Help employees understand what your company is actually investing in them, including the value of benefits and equity. Store, edit, and selectively share your pay bands from a single source-of-truth – no more miscellaneous versions floating around. Access the most reliable, granular source of benchmarking data for exec, individual contributor, AI, and board roles from 550+ VC-backed companies. Search current salary ranges from over 6,000 U.S. tech companies – it's free AND refreshed daily. Access global, multi-industry benchmarking data powered by Mercer, encompassing salaries from millions of employees. Access data from 9+ million employees sourced directly from HR departments and refreshed monthly. Pay equity analytics and auto-outlier detection highlight any existing pay gaps and employee inequity. Whether you’re using base salary, OTE, equity, bonus, variable comp, multiple countries and currencies — Comprehensive can handle it all. Comprehensive is GDPR, CCPA, and SOC 2 Type 2 compliant, making sure your sensitive data is always protected. Our compensation experts will get you operational in less than 2 weeks, with ongoing dedicated support.",
