    summary: "Learn how BILL automates back-office financial processes, saving businesses an average of 36 days a year. Join over 400,000 businesses simplifying their finance. BILL helps businesses run financial operations that hold up under real-world volume—from routine transactions to complex workflows. BILL brings payables, receivables, and spend management onto a single platform built on over $2 trillion in payments.⁵ Now, that foundation is powering agentic AI designed to anticipate needs and drive smarter business decisions. We don’t settle for the status quo. From automated workflows to smarter spend management and forecasting, we’re building the tools businesses need to move faster—and stay firmly in control. Our leadership team brings decades of experience from top financial and technology institutions—and is driving where financial operations are headed next. We design AI to elevate finance teams to shape strategy, not just process data. Introduction of syncs for accounting systems Automation of check payments and beginning of ACH support Closed $100M in financing from JPMorgan, Chase, Temasek, and others Signed deal with Chase Our mission is to make it simple for businesses to connect and do business. By automating the \"back office,\" we empower business owners to move beyond manual paperwork and focus on strategic growth. Our evolution from bill.com to BILL signifies our transformation from a bill-pay utility to a unified financial operations platform. By integrating spend mana",
