    stage: "",
    round: null,
    summary: "Learn about our tree Planting Promise and switch to OVO Energy today for fair, competitive energy prices. Lock in your energy prices with our 1 Year Fixed + Complete Cover tariff. You’ll get free home cover worth £240 included. Join Beyond 2 - our free loyalty programme. Collect points today and bank greener rewards for tomorrow. The longer you’re with us, the more you get. Keep an eye on your balance, get home energy insights, and manage your account on the go. All in the free OVO app. Check my latest bill Login to find all the details of your latest energy bill, balance and usage. Switch to OVO Join us on the path to energy that’s better for you, your wallet, and the planet. Latest offers Earn points for using electricity at greener times. Join Power Move Terms and eligibility apply . Rated 0.0 by more than 0 customers Our most popular products and services Charge Anytime Smart charge your car at home and on the go, with a Charge Anytime Monthly plan, and save up to £460 a year. 5 Unlock offers today, while you earn greener rewards for tomorrow. 2 It’s our way of saying thanks for being with us. Save up to 85% on your electricity use 6 when you get solar panels and a battery from OVO. Our free rewards programme rewards you just for being with us. Join thousands of customers on Beyond. 2 Use 85% or more of your electricity at greener times to earn extra points and bill credit with Power Move. 7 We’ve planted 5 million trees in schools and communities across the country, on b",
