    stage: "",
    round: null,
    summary: "Pulumi is an open-source infrastructure as code platform that helps humans and agents build and manage cloud infrastructure with real programming languages. Open source and powered by languages agents know well, Pulumi is infrastructure as software that gives humans and agents the tools they need to build and scale infrastructure — safely. GitHub GitHub $ pulumi up Pulumi IaC Infrastructure as code in any language Write infrastructure in the languages you already know and deploy to AWS, Azure, Google Cloud, Kubernetes, and hundreds more providers. Coding agents get the same type checking and tests you use. Pulumi ESC Centralized configuration, zero sprawl A single interface across all of your secrets. Pull in Vault, AWS Secrets Manager, Azure Key Vault, and more, plus support for short-lived credentials with OIDC. Discovery & governance Continuous compliance, by construction Find managed and unmanaged resources across clouds with natural language queries, then enforce policies and track compliance in real time.",
    person: null,
