    logo: "/logos/rootins.png",
    stage: "",
    round: null,
    summary: "We believe good drivers should pay less for auto insurance so we base rates primarily on how you drive. Get a free quote. Safe driving. Great insurance! I Switched from Geico, paid 6 months upfront and went from $1,100/6 months to $743/6 months. It’s so helpful for a single mom with a perfect driving record to not have to worry about my insurance bill going up every other month. Thank you. I am sooo happy to be saving about $1000 a year for my auto insurance. Root is an insurance that makes sense when it comes to how they price. Thanks Root! Get a quote and get on the road in less than 5 minutes with Root. It’s practical, simple, and fast car insurance for drivers who have more important stuff to do. Get a policy in less than 5 minutes Get a quote, bind your policy, and get on the road in minutes. It's that simple. Save more when you drive safely Drivers who share their driving data could qualify for a better rate. Our best drivers save up $109 a month. Easily manage your policy in the app Keep your car insurance close at hand by managing your policy right in the Root app. Access your insurance information and take care of your policy on the go, all from your phone. Earn a referral gift Refer a friend and you could both earn a reward offer when they take the test drive and get a quote. Visit our referral page to learn more about eligibility and how the program works. Get Roadside Assistance Get help when the unexpected leaves you stuck. O",
