    summary: "Protect your business from cyber and AI threats. Coalition combines comprehensive cyber insurance + AI coverage, with proactive security services. Brokers: Get Appointed Free Security Assessment See how Coalition’s active approach helped a policyholder claw back $1.5 million after a fraudulent funds transfer. Insurance that can stop cyber and AI threats in their tracks? Meet Coalition. Policyholders experience 73% fewer claims* and a seamless claims process when they do. Coalition's proprietary tech and expertise helps detect, assess, and mitigate cyber threats throughout the life of a policy for small businesses, while Coalition Control® gives alerts and easy-to-follow expert-led guidance to resolve new threats. Respond to threats fast with our security expertise Mitigate threats, recover systems, recoup funds Get cyber + AI coverage tailored for your digital risk From incident to recovery, we’ve got your back Level up your cybersecurity — add Wirespeed millisecond-fast response AI SOC Automated Detection & Response Verdict Engine Integrations An AI SOC that’s built for speed Fight machine-speed attacks with millisecond-fast containment & AI for deeper analysis. The perfect blend of determinism and AI for enterprises Machine speed. Surgical precision. Without the token burn. Active Cyber Insurance for Enterprises** is backed by Allianz’s A+ rating from AM Best, giving risk managers, brokers, and follow markets the financial confidence they need before the conversation begins",
