    logo: "/logos/prismic.png",
    stage: "",
    round: null,
    summary: "Prismic is the agentic web platform for marketing teams. Turn briefs into high-performing websites with AI agents and reusable components. Start free. Platform Solutions Developers Case studies Resources Pricing Login Get started Request a demo For Marketers For Developers Prompt new pages. Build new journeys Connect Prismic to Claude, ChatGPT, or any MCP-enabled AI tool. Create new pages, rewrite existing ones, or make updates with a prompt. Then review every change in Prismic and publish when you’re ready. Your brand already lives in Prismic. Your sections (slices), content structure, and guidelines give your team and AI the same rules to work from. Create SEO pages, launch campaigns, and update your site at scale without drifting off-brand. Connect Prismic to Claude, ChatGPT, or any MCP-enabled AI tool. Let AI do the heavy lifting. Review and publish in Prismic. The work your team already does, without all the manual steps. Connect Prismic to your AI tools and put them to work on real content. Give your AI a source page. It adapts the content across locales while keeping the same structure. Rewrite titles, audit SEO and AI search, update CTAs, quotes, and more across multiple pages. Review everything in Prismic, then publish all your changes at once. Use Prismic as your AI landing page builder. Describe the campaign and your AI assembles the page from your own slices, on brand and ready for review. Adjust the design or copy, then publish when it’s right. Whole sites, blogs",
    person: null,
    funder: "",
    source: "Company site",
    sourceUrl: "https://prismic.io/",
    files: [{"title": "About", "text": "Platform Solutions Developers Case studies Resources Pricing Login Get started Request a demo We’re passionate about websites And we’re on a mission to empower everyone, individuals and organizations to express their identity and grow their business online. Our goal is to change the way that people succeed online, and we’re starting with how they achieve growth through their websites. And even our internal culture encourages people to grow their careers by taking on new challenges. Seeing others, especially our clients, succeed and figuring out how we can continuously support them is what gets us out of bed every morning. We’re developers and marketers just like our users, leveraging our own tools for growth. You can be sure we’ll share every secret we discover through the innovations we implement in our tools. Our headquarters is in Paris, France, and our team is spread across more than 10 countries, comprising over 20 different nationalities. This cultural diversity greatly benefits employee relations and interactions with our users."}],

