    summary: "The world awaits No matter where you’re headed, we’ll help you get there. On-demand, scheduled ahead, late night, or morning commute. Plus, earn rewards on every ride. Shift into earnings mode With Lyft, you can be your own boss, set your own schedule, and drive when it makes sense for you. You keep 100% of your tips, and can cash out instantly whenever you want. Ride with Lyft A few quick taps, one great trip Ride with Lyft A few quick taps, one great trip No matter your destination, we’ll get you where you need to go Get a reliable ride in minutes Schedule your ride in advance Earn rewards on every ride Sign up to ride Learn more about riding with Lyft Unlock more on every ride Unlock more on every ride Earn credits when you ride, save on DoorDash orders, and feel good about rides that give back. All with one membership. Free for your first month, then $9.99/mo after that. Cancel anytime. DashPass membership included Enjoy $0 delivery fees and reduced service fees on eligible DoorDash orders *Lyft Credits earning excludes shared rides and Lyft Business rides. Bike and scooter rides in Boston and Washington DC are also excluded. Subject to the Lyft Go Terms & Conditions , Lyft x DoorDash Terms & Conditions , and Lyft Terms of Service . We’ve got options to get you where you’re going. Choose a ride that suits your mood and budget.* Helping your business go places, literally",
