    summary: "Pinterest is where ideas start online and turn into real-life moments. Discover what feels like you and shop in the most positive place online. Explore visual ideas (Pins) and get to know boards—collections of Pins that bring ideas together. You'll find a steady stream of fresh inspiration from Featured boards handpicked by experts and AI-powered boards tailored to your taste. See more of what you love and discover ideas that match your style—even when you don’t have the words yet. Turn them into visual collages and save your favorite Pins to boards to plan your next project. Save what you love and shop it right from your board. Turn the ideas you discover into pieces for your home, your wardrobe and your everyday life. Find inspiration that reflects your body type with filters that let you discover relevant outfits and ideas that are true to you. Through the Pinterest Impact Fund, we’ve invested $30M in 60+ nonprofits to fuel emotional wellbeing in our communities. 1 You and your family choose who can contact you or see your content on Pinterest with age verification and parental passcodes. Customize your search results by skin tone range and hair type, so you can see how that lipstick or hat might look on you. With the Inspired Internet Pledge , Pinterest is building a safer, kinder and more positive place online for young people everywhere. 2",
